{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819410/extras/Title.png?t=1748854935\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Objective:</strong> Survive a full shift in the heart of galactic logistics!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Teamwork:</strong> Work together to keep the station running, sort the deliveries.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Reputation:</strong> Unlock new sectors and upgrade your station with increasingly wild modules.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819410/extras/Launch_the_ship.gif?t=1748854935\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>RECEIVE LLAMAS, FORWARD BLACK HOLES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your mission is simple: deal with unpredictable cargo no matter what! Expect living creatures, spatial anomalies, and other absurd surprises. Stay sharp \u2014 a single mishandled delivery can turn into total chaos.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819410/extras/Llama_on_fire.gif?t=1748854935\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>TEAMWORK BEFORE TOTAL IMPLOSION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To survive your shift, you\u2019ll need to stick together: fix systems, manage crises, and most importantly \u2014 communicate. In a station where anything can explode at any time, no one can afford to slack off.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819410/extras/Whale_attack.gif?t=1748854935\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FROM ZERO TO GALACTIC HERO</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With hard-earned reputation (and a pinch of dumb luck), unlock new zones, receive ever-weirder packages, and upgrade your station with even more over-the-top tools.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2819410?t=1748854935","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819410/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748854935","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819410/a9d863bbe2cd9b19e37e379b2e688bb7f563202b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748854935","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819410/a9d863bbe2cd9b19e37e379b2e688bb7f563202b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748854935","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819410/extras/Title.png?t=1748854935\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Objective:</strong> Survive a full shift in the heart of galactic logistics!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Teamwork:</strong> Work together to keep the station running, sort the deliveries.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Reputation:</strong> Unlock new sectors and upgrade your station with increasingly wild modules.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819410/extras/Launch_the_ship.gif?t=1748854935\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>RECEIVE LLAMAS, FORWARD BLACK HOLES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your mission is simple: deal with unpredictable cargo no matter what! Expect living creatures, spatial anomalies, and other absurd surprises. Stay sharp \u2014 a single mishandled delivery can turn into tot